    <<print '<div class="meter-fill" style="height:' + ($ratings * 10) + '%;"></div>'>>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="fundingBar">
  <div class="meter-container" style="margin-left: auto;">
    <<print '<div class="meter-fill funding-color" style="height:' + ($funding * 10) + '%;"></div>'>>
  </div>
</div>


<span class="textbox">They are demanding a product placement for their Family-size lasagna right now while Truman isn't doing anything. It would be hard to force a product placement right now, but it could be done.</span>

<span class="bottom-left">[[Force Placement->Force Placement]]</span>
<span class="bottom-right">[[Refuse Placement->End Call]]</span>


